<title>USA: Mallinckrodt Inc Q2 Dec 31 full results.</title>
<headline>Mallinckrodt Inc Q2 Dec 31 full results.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>($ in millions, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>						1996		    1995</p>
<p> Net sales				  571.1		   528.2</p>
<p> Earnings on continuing operations   44.1		    38.3</p>
<p> Discontinued operations (a)	   (.6)		    19.0</p>
<p> Net earnings				43.5		    57.3</p>
<p> Preferred stock dividends	     (.1)		    (.1)</p>
<p> Available for common shareholders   43.4		    57.2</p>
<p>Earnings per common share</p>
<p> Continuing operations		    .58		     .50</p>
<p> Discontinued operations (a)	  (.01)		     .25</p>
<p> Net earnings				 .57		     .75</p>
<p> Average common shares	   75,795,000	    76,398,000</p>
<p>			 SIX MONTHS ENDED DECEMBER 31</p>
<p>	     ($ in millions, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>					    1996			1995</p>
<p> Net sales			    1,112.5		   1,020.3</p>
<p>Earnings from continuing</p>
<p>  operations (b)			 80.2			74.0</p>
<p> Discontinued operations (a)	(1.3)			22.5</p>
<p> Net earnings			    78.9			96.5</p>
<p> Available for common shareholders 78.7			96.3</p>
<p>Earnings per common share</p>
<p> Continuing operations (b)	   1.06			 .96</p>
<p> Discontinued operations (a)	(.02)			 .29</p>
<p> Net earnings			    1.04			1.25</p>
<p> Average common shares	 75,642,000		77,161,000</p>
<p>NOTE: (a) Included in discontinued operations for the quarter and six months ended December 31, 1995, are earnings, net of taxes, from the divested Feed Ingredients business of $1.0 million and $5.5 million, respectively. In addition, discontinued operations reflect an after tax gain of $34.4 million on the sale of the Feed Ingredients business and a provision for additional environmental costs.</p>
<p>(b) Included in earnings from continuing operations for the six months ended December 31, 1996, is a one-time research and development charge of $6.0 million, $3.8 million after taxes or $0.05 per share resulting from a strategic alliance to develop new magnetic resonance imaging technology.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
